Chapter 26 - Drugs and Cosmetics\
Article 2B - Lynn and Erin Compassionate Use Act\
Section 26-2B-4 - Exemption from criminal and civil penalties for the medical use of cannabis.\
Universal Citation:\
NM Stat \'a7 26-2B-4 (2025)\
